<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῠρεός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stone put against a door</i> to keep it shut, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.240
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				313
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>oblong shield (shaped like a door)</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.428.36
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, Inscr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Callix.
				2
			</span></i>; hence, of the Roman <i>scutum</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίς</span>,= <i>clipeus</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.30.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.23.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.16
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				6.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				163.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>disk</i> forming part of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθετήρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				68
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Math., <i>oval</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Deff.</u>
				3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>.</div>
